    },
    {
      "number": 115,
      "text": "Or would you like to question your Messenger as Moses was questioned before? Whoever exchanges faith for disbelief has indeed strayed from the sound path.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 2,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَقَرَةِ",
