      "hizbQuarter": 7,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 118,
      "text": "And they say, “None will enter Paradise except a Jew or a Christian.” That is their wishful thinking. Say, “Produce your proof, if you are truthful.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 2,
        "name": "سُورَةُ البَقَرَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Baqara",
